1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Welcome to Stock-AI: Multimodal AI for Stock Trend Prediction.

2
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:13,000
Financial markets represent one of the lowest signal-to-noise ratio domains in applied artificial intelligence.

3
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:20,000
While academic literature frequently reports inflated directional forecasting accuracies, they often collapse out-of-sample.

4
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:28,000
Our goal is to establish an academically rigorous, leakage-free benchmark across 12 equities over 16 years of market data.

5
00:00:28,500 --> 00:00:36,000
We investigate whether fusing financial news sentiment with price series yields genuine alpha over classical baselines.

6
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:53,000
Our research builds upon recent work published in Neural Computing and Applications (DOI: 10.1007/s00521-024-10303-1).

7
00:00:53,500 --> 00:01:02,000
The target is binary classification: forecasting whether Close price on day t exceeds Close on day t-1.

8
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:12,000
The market branch processes a 20-day by 16-feature temporal tensor through stacked Bidirectional LSTMs.

9
00:01:12,500 --> 00:01:21,000
The linguistic branch extracts dense 768-dimensional FinBERT embeddings from financial news headlines.

10
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:30,000
Both representations project into a common 64-dimensional latent space for downstream fusion.

11
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:09,000
Absolute data integrity is non-negotiable. We eliminate data leakage through three strict architectural guarantees.

12
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:18,000
First: Strict Chronological Partitioning. Training through 2022, validation through mid-2024, and 6,292 test sessions.

13
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:27,000
Second: Sequence Isolation. Every 20-day market window strictly terminates on trading session t-1.

14
00:02:27,500 --> 00:02:35,000
MinMax scaling parameters are fit solely on training data, preventing cross-temporal distributional leakage.

15
00:02:35,500 --> 00:02:44,000
Third: Handling Corporate Actions. For ATVI (delisted Oct 2023), we enforce a verified historical fallback provider.

16
00:03:31,000 --> 00:03:38,000
We explore multiple tiers of model complexity: heuristics, linear models, and recurrent neural networks.

17
00:03:38,500 --> 00:03:47,000
Our baselines include Training-Majority, Direction Persistence, and Logistic Regression on t-1 features.

18
00:03:47,500 --> 00:03:56,000
For multimodal fusion, we implement a Gated Multimodal Unit (GMU) rather than naive feature concatenation.

19
00:03:56,500 --> 00:04:06,000
The GMU learns a gating vector z to perform a convex combination between market sequences and news embeddings.

20
00:04:06,500 --> 00:04:16,000
This dynamically suppresses linguistic noise while amplifying high-conviction corporate catalysts.

21
00:05:16,000 --> 00:05:25,000
Evaluating across 6,292 out-of-sample forward test observations reveals crucial financial realities.

22
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:34,000
Shared Multi-Ticker BiLSTM achieves 52.13% directional accuracy, outperforming the Majority baseline (51.21%).

23
00:05:34,500 --> 00:05:43,000
In modern efficient equity markets, 52% to 54% represents realistic, non-overfit directional edge.

24
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:52,000
Cross-asset pooling provides +3.55% accuracy improvement over single-ticker training through shared regularization.

25
00:05:52,500 --> 00:06:02,000
Linear models achieve higher Macro F1 (0.4704) by maintaining sensitivity across both upward and downward regimes.

26
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Stock-AI is packaged as a complete research platform with core library, REST API, and dashboard.

27
00:07:10,500 --> 00:07:19,000
The Python library features data downloaders, technical indicators, window builders, and 40 passing tests.

28
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:28,000
FastAPI exposes endpoints for ticker metadata, historical OHLCV series, metrics, and inference.

29
00:07:28,500 --> 00:07:38,000
The React/TypeScript frontend provides an interactive Stock Explorer, Model Lab, and Prediction Demonstration.

30
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Daily news headlines lack intraday timestamps, warranting a conservative TIMING-LIMITED designation.

31
00:08:40,500 --> 00:08:49,000
Future research will integrate high-frequency SEC Edgar 8-K filings and cross-asset graph attention.

32
00:08:49,500 --> 00:09:00,000
Full codebase, manifests, and documentation are available at github.com/Kavix28/Stock-AI.
